    "The printed sentence beginning One of the major shortcomings is grammatically unusual but faithfully retained. The abstract prints 1000X; it is not rewritten as a multiplication symbol. OCR lexical hyphens and quotation typography were checked against the images.",
    "Descriptions of prior metric inadequacy are limitation, while the proposed modular scenario operations are mechanism. The statement positioning Wattch as complementary is scope."
